---

<section id="profile" class="profile-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card profile-card">
      <div class="profile-content">
        <div class="profile-info">
          <h1 class="text-center">백엔드 개발자 김백엔드</h1>
          <p class="subtitle text-center">5년차 백엔드 개발자</p>
          <div class="intro">
            <p>안녕하세요. 5년간 백엔드 개발을 해온 개발자입니다.</p>
            <p>주로 Java/Spring, Python, Node.js 를 활용한 서버 개발과 AWS 클라우드 인프라 구축 경험이 있습니다.</p>
            <p>대용량 트래픽 처리와 마이크로서비스 아키텍처 설계에 관심이 많습니다.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="skills">
            <h3>주요 기술 스택</h3>
            <div class="skill-tags">
              <span class="tag">Java</span>
              <span class="tag">Spring Boot</span>
              <span class="tag">Python</span>
              <span class="tag">Django</span>
              <span class="tag">Node.js</span>
              <span class="tag">AWS</span>
              <span class="tag">Docker</span>
              <span class="tag">Kubernetes</span>
              <span class="tag">MySQL</span>
              <span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span>
              <span class="tag">Redis</span>
              <span class="tag">Kafka</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-info">
            <div class="contact-item">
              <strong>이메일:</strong> backend.dev@example.com
            </div>
            <div class="contact-item">
              <strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/backend-dev" target="_blank">github.com/backend-dev</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .profile-section {
    padding: 60px 0;
  }

  .profile-card {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #7f8c8d;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .intro {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .intro p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .skills {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .skill-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .contact-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
  }

  .contact-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .contact-item a {
    color: #3498db;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contact-item a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .profile-section {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .intro p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .contact-info {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .contact-item {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 4px;
    }
  }
</style>